    - Partition count
    - Replication factor
    - Broker count
    - Storage calculation
    - Retention period
    - Compression
    - Producer batching
    - Consumer parallelism
    - Ordering key
    - Backpressure
    - Retry and DLT strategy
    - Idempotency
    - Schema governance
    - Monitoring
    - Security
